    "detailed_description": "<h1>Beta v1 Update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/885af674a14e018b18a5eef2c253d432.poster.avif?t=1753990559\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/885af674a14e018b18a5eef2c253d432.webm?t=1753990559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/885af674a14e018b18a5eef2c253d432.mp4?t=1753990559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/24a554332b0c08c6028a28c5a6aa7da5.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Palettopia</i> is the relaxing city-painting game where creativity meets harmony. Discover unique islands, work with their natural landscapes, and paint vibrant districts to bring your dream utopia to life. With infinite islands to explore and endless possibilities to create, your journey to building paradise is as peaceful as it is rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/5576663ebae1db495b2550ebf398247b.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>Meet the needs of the Palettopians by creatively painting and arranging city districts. Each district has specific requirements, and your challenge is to balance these needs while crafting a visually stunning and harmonious island. Complete all 7 district types to unlock joyous celebrations and transform each island into a thriving paradise. Can you create a masterpiece that satisfies both the Palettopians and your own artistic vision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/37a56a0730be0f6f4a6141c84a19c43f.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Paint Your Paradise</strong>: Design your city by painting districts to suit the needs of the Palettopians. <br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Dynamic Needs System</strong>: Strategically combine districts to meet needs and unlock growth.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Infinite Islands</strong>: Explore procedurally generated maps for endless creativity and discovery.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Varying Climates:</strong> Choose from 4 Biome environments - Arid, Temperate, Arctic or Jungle<br>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0<strong>Delightful Surprises:</strong> Discover cute critters, Landmark structures, and unique Palettopians<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Creative Flexibility</strong>: Erase and adjust your districts at any time for a stress-free experience. \u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Photo Mode</strong>: Zoom in to capture breathtaking snapshots of your utopia. <br>\u23f3 <strong>History Timelapse</strong>: Relive your progress and watch your creation evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a19ab422e97910df7299db63e057ea1e.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span><i>Palettopia</i> is lovingly crafted by a small team of friends and family united by a passion for video games, art, and creativity. Together, we aim to share the joy and wonder of building beautiful things with others.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/24a554332b0c08c6028a28c5a6aa7da5.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Palettopia</i> is the relaxing city-painting game where creativity meets harmony. Discover unique islands, work with their natural landscapes, and paint vibrant districts to bring your dream utopia to life. With infinite islands to explore and endless possibilities to create, your journey to building paradise is as peaceful as it is rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/5576663ebae1db495b2550ebf398247b.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>Meet the needs of the Palettopians by creatively painting and arranging city districts. Each district has specific requirements, and your challenge is to balance these needs while crafting a visually stunning and harmonious island. Complete all 7 district types to unlock joyous celebrations and transform each island into a thriving paradise. Can you create a masterpiece that satisfies both the Palettopians and your own artistic vision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/37a56a0730be0f6f4a6141c84a19c43f.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Paint Your Paradise</strong>: Design your city by painting districts to suit the needs of the Palettopians. <br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Dynamic Needs System</strong>: Strategically combine districts to meet needs and unlock growth.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Infinite Islands</strong>: Explore procedurally generated maps for endless creativity and discovery.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Varying Climates:</strong> Choose from 4 Biome environments - Arid, Temperate, Arctic or Jungle<br>\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0<strong>Delightful Surprises:</strong> Discover cute critters, Landmark structures, and unique Palettopians<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Creative Flexibility</strong>: Erase and adjust your districts at any time for a stress-free experience. \u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Photo Mode</strong>: Zoom in to capture breathtaking snapshots of your utopia. <br>\u23f3 <strong>History Timelapse</strong>: Relive your progress and watch your creation evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004170/extras/a19ab422e97910df7299db63e057ea1e.avif?t=1753990559\" width=1232 height=156 /></span><i>Palettopia</i> is lovingly crafted by a small team of friends and family united by a passion for video games, art, and creativity. Together, we aim to share the joy and wonder of building beautiful things with others.</p>",
